%rec: default
# skills.rec: the engine's own skills, embedded in the game. Every mod can use one by its id alone - in
# classes.rec's start_spells ("arrow_rain=0"), an item's `spell:` (a scroll, a staff, a book that raises it) - and
# a mod's own spells.rec record with the same id replaces the whole record here. The fields are spells.rec's
# (see files/mods/d1/data/spells.rec), plus the ones only a named skill carries:
#   name / description   what menus and tooltips show
#   mana / mana_adj / min_mana   a cast's mana: mana - (level-1)*mana_adj, never below min_mana, times the class's
#                     mana_cost. A sustained skill costs this for every extra arrow it looses instead
#   min_int           the magic a scroll or book of it needs
#   targeting         how the hero aims it: direct, melee, ranged, jumpstart(sprint), earthshaker(sprint);
#                     blank aims like a spell. The skill level is appended to its arguments
#   sustained         true: casting toggles it on and off instead of casting it (Multi-Shot)
#   icon              the tile drawn when the mod's icons/skills.rec has no spell.<id>
#   town              true: it works in town
# Every effect gets the skill level as its last argument, which is what it scales with.

# The Archer

id: multi_shot
name: Multi-Shot
description: While it is up, every shot looses one more arrow per level (2-6) at the nearest enemies, and each extra arrow costs its mana.
sustained: true
mana: 2
icon: 44

id: arrow_rain
name: Arrow Rain
description: Arrows fall on an area (3x3, 5x5 from level 3) and strike at random what they find there; whatever cannot move is always hit.
targeted: true
targeting: ranged
effect: arrow_rain
mana: 8
icon: 223

id: trick_shot
name: Trick Shot
description: One arrow pierces every enemy in its line (2 more per level, all of them at level 5) and bounces off walls (1 bounce per level + 1).
targeted: true
targeting: ranged
effect: trick_shot
mana: 6
icon: 223

id: debilitating_shot
name: Debilitating Shot
description: A quick action: the next arrow that hits stuns, scares, confuses, enrages or poisons for 1 turn per level + 1, and pins down an enemy standing against a wall.
effect: debilitating_shot
mana: 4
icon: 223

id: man_stopper
name: Man Stopper
description: A shot that knocks its target back 1 cell per level; hitting a wall hurts it more.
targeted: true
targeting: ranged
effect: man_stopper
mana: 5
icon: 223

id: jump_start
name: Jump Start
description: Run up to an enemy, jump over it (farther with each level) and shoot it in the back.
targeted: true
targeting: jumpstart(5)
effect: jumpstart(5)
mana: 5
icon: 223

# The Warrior

id: crush
name: Crush
description: A blow at 20% more damage per level through two enemies in a line; one against a wall takes half as much again.
targeted: true
targeting: melee
effect: crush
mana: 5
icon: 223

id: shout
name: Shout
description: Every enemy on the level hears you, and those that see you flee for 1 turn per level + 2.
effect: shout
mana: 6
icon: 223

id: swing
name: Swing
description: One blow at every enemy in the three cells in front of you.
targeted: true
targeting: melee
effect: swing
mana: 5
icon: 223

id: whirlwind_of_doom
name: Whirlwind of Doom
description: Spin up to 1 cell per level in a straight line, striking every enemy you pass; one against a wall takes half as much again.
targeted: true
targeting: direct
effect: whirlwind
mana: 8
icon: 223

id: earth_shaker
name: Earth Shaker
description: Rush forward and strike every enemy around where you land, pushing them back 1 cell per level.
targeted: true
targeting: earthshaker(5)
hit_zone: neighbors_only(1)
effect: earthshaker(5)
mana: 8
icon: 223

id: triumph_of_steel
name: Triumph of Steel
description: For 5 turns per level, every kill heals you and adds to your damage.
effect: triumph_of_steel
mana: 10
icon: 223

id: call_to_odin
name: Call to Odin
description: Lightning strikes up to one visible enemy per level + 1.
resist: lightning
effect: call_to_odin
mana: 12
icon: 223

# The Mage

id: black_clouds
name: Black Clouds
description: A choking cloud (3x3, 5x5 from level 3) that poisons and confuses whatever breathes it, for 1 turn per level + 3.
targeted: true
effect: black_clouds
mana: 10
icon: 223

id: burning_rain
name: Burning Rain
description: For 1 turn per level + 2, fire falls on three cells around the target every turn.
targeted: true
resist: fire
effect: burning_rain
mana: 14
icon: 223

id: great_thunder
name: Great Thunder
description: A thunderbolt on the target, and everything next to it is stunned.
targeted: true
resist: lightning
effect: great_thunder
mana: 16
icon: 223

id: eternal_vow
name: Eternal Vow
description: For 5 turns per level, the first blow that would kill you leaves you standing with 1 life.
effect: eternal_vow
mana: 20
icon: 223

id: bat_out_of_hell
name: Bat out of Hell
description: Fly up to 2 cells + 1 per level in a straight line through enemies, burning each one you pass.
targeted: true
targeting: direct
resist: fire
effect: bat_out_of_hell
mana: 10
icon: 223

# Skills that were class skills before they had levels

id: blink
name: Blink
description: Teleport to a cell you can see.
targeted: true
targeting: direct
effect: blink
mana: 5
icon: 223

id: poison_target
name: Poison
description: Poison a target for 3 turns.
targeted: true
targeting: direct
effect: poison(3|1d3)
mana: 4
icon: 223

id: fire_ray
name: Fire Ray
description: A ray of fire seven cells long.
targeted: true
targeting: ranged
hit_zone: ray_aoe(7)
effect: project_fire
mana: 8
icon: 223

id: heal_health
name: Heal
description: Heal yourself by 20 life.
effect: on_self(heal_health|20)
mana: 6
icon: 332

id: shield
name: Shield
description: Wrap yourself or an ally in a shield that absorbs the next 10 damage per level. It vanishes when you die.
targeted: true
targeting: direct
allow_self_target: true
effect: shield
mana: 6
icon: 203
